  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SF - Vatten Korttidskonsult</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SF -Ken Water Sector Dev Prog-Bridging Consultants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mrs Christine Katee (component 01) her role as a short term consultant is to assist Sida/the Swedish Embassy in Nairobi and the Kenya water sector in Nairobi in pursuing the smooth winding up of KWSP and in the preparations for the new Swedish bridging support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The short term consultancy contract with Mr Muchori and Mr Makau (component 02 and 03) is to assist the MWI to finalise the bridge proposal to be submitted to MWI and after revision to the Embassy of Sweden by August 2010. Due to the MWI procurement restrictions the conusultant were not able to extend the contract period so that they could finalize the proposal.</narrative>
  </description>
